From: zhaosiying12138 <neucszhaopeng2016@163.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 09:53:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 19/42] feat(amdgpu): route generic dispatch v2 requests

Add an owner-bound MessageType 18 bridge route with canonical type 19 failures, native MAP/ALLOC/UNMAP state, validated H2D kernarg publication, bounded disconnect cleanup, and explicit fail-closed ALLOC/SUBMIT gates. Keep generic capability bit 8 unadvertised and make no GPU execution claim.

